{#
  Sent when today's edition will not arrive.

  Deliberately independent of everything else: no news data, no build output,
  no external images, no model. If the build is broken this template must
  still render, so it takes only a first name and two links.

  Content is generic on purpose. A reader does not need our stack trace, and
  naming the cause invites follow-up questions we cannot answer at 09:05.
#}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:{{ pal.paper }};margin:0;padding:0;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:20px 10px;">
<table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:560px;max-width:100%;background:{{ pal.paper_raised }};border:2px solid {{ pal.ink }};">
  <tr><td style="padding:26px 28px 14px 28px;border-bottom:4px double {{ pal.ink }};">
    <h1 style="margin:0;font-family:{{ pal.serif }};font-size:30px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:bold;color:{{ pal.ink }};">
      {{ brand }}
    </h1>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:22px 28px 26px 28px;">
    <p style="margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:{{ pal.serif }};font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:{{ pal.ink }};">
      Good morning {{ first_name }},
    </p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:{{ pal.serif }};font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:{{ pal.ink }};">
      Today's edition didn't make it out. We're sorry — that's on us, not on
      anything you did.
    </p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:{{ pal.serif }};font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:{{ pal.ink }};">
      There's nothing you need to do. Your next edition should arrive at its
      usual time tomorrow morning.
    </p>
    <p style="margin:24px 0 0 0;font-family:{{ pal.sans }};font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:{{ pal.ink_muted }};">
      <a href="{{ preferences_url }}" style="color:{{ pal.ink_muted }};">Manage your preferences</a>
      &nbsp;·&nbsp;
      <a href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}" style="color:{{ pal.ink_muted }};">Unsubscribe</a>
    </p>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
